    {
      "subId": "4014501",
      "subQuestName": "Go back to the shop",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401450101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401450101": {
            "id": "401450101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "After a brief trial period, the potion shop opens to great success...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450102"
            ]
          },
          "401450102": {
            "id": "401450102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "*sigh* We just keep getting swarmed with more and more customers. It's been nonstop work for so long, Paimon's starting to feel a bit lightheaded...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450105"
            ]
          },
          "401450105": {
            "id": "401450105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We've got a lot of orders. Paimon's not sure we can fill them all on our own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450106"
            ]
          },
          "401450106": {
            "id": "401450106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe we should hire some help...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450107"
            ]
          },
          "401450107": {
            "id": "401450107",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Taking a break, cuties?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450108"
            ]
          },
          "401450108": {
            "id": "401450108",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "I was just looking at the sales data, and it seems like you two have quite the talent for business. The potions seem to be flying off the shelves!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450109"
            ]
          },
          "401450109": {
            "id": "401450109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, Lisa! Perfect timing! We were just talking about how we could use some help around the shop.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450110"
            ]
          },
          "401450110": {
            "id": "401450110",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Oh? Are the orders piling up already? Having trouble keeping up?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450111"
            ]
          },
          "401450111": {
            "id": "401450111",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yep, we're officially swamped! Paimon never thought we'd get this many customers...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450112"
            ]
          },
          "401450112": {
            "id": "401450112",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Well, I can't say I'm surprised by the success. I was actually anticipating this kind of response.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450113"
            ]
          },
          "401450113": {
            "id": "401450113",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "While you two were busy with the shop, I was talking with Freda about some possible ways to make the business more efficient.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450114"
            ]
          },
          "401450114": {
            "id": "401450114",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "After observing your work, I made note of several improvements we can make to the brewing, cultivation, and sales aspects of the business.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450115"
            ]
          },
          "401450115": {
            "id": "401450115",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, so you've been doing things behind the scenes this whole time!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450116"
            ]
          },
          "401450116": {
            "id": "401450116",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon kinda thought you were just slacking off...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450117"
            ]
          },
          "401450117": {
            "id": "401450117",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Hey now, I'm actually pretty reliable when it counts!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450118"
            ]
          },
          "401450118": {
            "id": "401450118",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So how are we supposed to put those improvements in action?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450119"
            ]
          },
          "401450119": {
            "id": "401450119",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "Well, I discussed things over with Freda, and the two of us came up with a plan.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401450120"
            ]
          },
          "401450120": {
            "id": "401450120",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Lisa",
            "text": "I'll let her give you the details, though. Why don't you go and find her?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014502",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Lisa",
      "sceneId": null,
